  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cost Extension GP IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to alleviate the pressure on the war affected population in Ukraine in locations where energy, water and heating infrastructure has been damaged by stabilising the uninterrupted electricity, water  and heat supply. In addition, it will support the procurement of school buses and specialize vehicles to support access to education and other services to conflict-affected children.</narrative>
  </description>
